{"ref":"BDB, מַלְקוֹחַ","hw":"מַלְקוֹחַ","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְקוֹחַ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.25\">Is 49:25</a></sup> <strong>booty, prey</strong> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָקַח</span> <strong>9</strong>);—<span dir=\"rtl\">הֲיֻקַּח מִגִּבּוֹר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.24\">Is 49:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִי</span>), cf. v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.25\">25</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:26\" href=\"/Numbers.31.26\">Nu 31:26</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:11\" href=\"/Numbers.31.11\">31:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלָל</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:12\" href=\"/Numbers.31.12\">12</a> (‖ <em>id.</em> + <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִי</span>, i.e. here, only, disting. from captives), v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:32\" href=\"/Numbers.31.32\">32</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶתֶר הַבָּ֔ז</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:27\" href=\"/Numbers.31.27\">27</a>.","next":"BDB, מַלְקוֹחַ²","prev":"BDB, לִקְחִי"}